WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.315
For a front desk update, first read Comments so you do not repeat an earlier message.

00:00:05.315 --> 00:00:10.975
Post the concrete change, such as the spare being ready, and verify it appears with its author.

00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:19.335
If another shift must perform a test, put that action in a resolution follow-up as well; do not rely on a discussion message to change status.
